# The local rehearsal server, its certificates and its data never go up. server.py in particular:
# what runs on Vercel is api/, and nothing should mistake the two.
#
# The root data/ folder is named by file, not as a folder. A bare "data/" also matches public/data/,
# which is where trip.json lives, and the whole trip then goes missing from the deployment with
# nothing in the build log to say so. None of the names below exist under public/.
server.py
tls
qa
tools
docs
data/key_token.txt
data/notes.json
data/overrides.json
data/letters.json
data/events.json
data/media
node_modules
__pycache__
.DS_Store
